41. If you cannot modify Power Apps

If you don't want to add GenerateRequest, there is a second option.

You can have Power Automate:

1. Wait 30 seconds.


2. Get all records for ReferenceNo.


3. Find the lowest SharePoint ID.


4. Only the lowest ID generates the document.


5. All other runs terminate.



Conceptually:

ID 101 ─┐
ID 102 ─┼── ReferenceNo GNS-202610-0097
ID 103 ─┘
             │
             ▼
       Lowest ID = 101
             │
             ▼
       ID 101 generates
       ID 102 terminates
       ID 103 terminates

But I don't recommend this as the primary production solution, because if ID 101 starts before IDs 102/103 are created, it can still generate an incomplete document. A GenerateRequest/ready flag is much safer.


